{"route":"/hop/wiki/scoring","title":"Scoring in depth - House of Pips Wiki","description":"Exactly how House of Pips adds up a play's points and a hand award, in order: perk bonuses, Midas Touch, Golden Double, The Equalizer, maluses, Pip Shield, Malus Ward and skill bonuses.","html":"<h1 id=\"scoring-in-depth\">Scoring in depth</h1>\n<p>Most of the time a play scores its open-end total plus a few perk bonuses. When several perks and maluses meet on one play, the <strong>order</strong> they apply in decides the result. This page lists that order for scoring plays and for the hand award.</p>\n<h2 id=\"which-plays-score\">Which plays score <a class=\"anchor\" href=\"/hop/wiki/scoring#which-plays-score\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<p>A play scores when, after your bone is placed, the open ends add up to a <strong>positive multiple of five</strong>. Perk bonuses can only add to a play that already scores; no perk turns a total of 12 into a scoring play. (The <a class=\"ref rarity-rare\" href=\"/hop/wiki/supplies#pip_eraser\" title=\"Rare supply\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/supplies/pip_eraser-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Pip Eraser</a> supply is the exception: it lowers the total before this check, so it can turn 16 into a scoring 15.)</p>\n<h2 id=\"reading-the-flying-counts\">Reading the flying counts <a class=\"anchor\" href=\"/hop/wiki/scoring#reading-the-flying-counts\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<p>The numbers that fly from the table show each scoring end's contribution. An exposed double counts both halves, so a double-one shows <strong>2</strong>. Bare short sides of a spinner show no number because they add no points. A blank scoring end can still show <strong>0</strong>.</p>\n<p>Here the outer ends contribute <strong>4 + 1 = 5</strong>. The double-one's long sides are covered, and its empty short sides add nothing.</p>\n<figure class=\"shot\"><a href=\"hop/wiki-data/img/screens/score-ends.png\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/screens/score-ends.png\" alt=\"Online scoring: only the outer 4 and 1 fly toward the five-point total; the spinner&#x27;s bare short sides show no counts.\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></a><figcaption>Online scoring: only the outer 4 and 1 fly toward the five-point total; the spinner's bare short sides show no counts.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Solo and online play show the same adjusted end counts. If <a class=\"ref rarity-rare\" href=\"/hop/wiki/supplies#pip_eraser\" title=\"Rare supply\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/supplies/pip_eraser-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Pip Eraser</a> reduces an exposed double-six's contribution from 12 to <strong>11</strong>, the flying number is <strong>11</strong>. With <strong>4</strong> at the other end, the base total is <strong>15</strong>, matching the scoring sequence and Ledger.</p>\n<figure class=\"shot\"><a href=\"hop/wiki-data/img/screens/score-eraser.png\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/screens/score-eraser.png\" alt=\"Solo and online counts use the same Pip Eraser deduction: an exposed double-six contributes 11, plus 4 for a base score of 15.\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></a><figcaption>Solo and online counts use the same Pip Eraser deduction: an exposed double-six contributes 11, plus 4 for a base score of 15.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"the-order-on-a-scoring-play\">The order on a scoring play <a class=\"anchor\" href=\"/hop/wiki/scoring#the-order-on-a-scoring-play\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<ol><li><strong>Open-end total.</strong> The sum of the open ends after your play, including any <a class=\"ref rarity-rare\" href=\"/hop/wiki/supplies#pip_eraser\" title=\"Rare supply\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/supplies/pip_eraser-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Pip Eraser</a> reduction.</li><li><strong>Perk bonuses</strong> are added, each multiplied by the number of copies you hold. In order: <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/doubles\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/doubles-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Double Trouble</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/blank\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/blank-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Zero Hero</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/draw\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/draw-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Lucky Pocket</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-uncommon\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/chain\" title=\"Uncommon perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/chain-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Hot Streak</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-uncommon\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/underdog\" title=\"Uncommon perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/underdog-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Comeback Kid</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/lowball\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/lowball-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Low Rider</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/odd_job\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/odd_job-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Odd Job</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/even_flow\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/even_flow-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Even Flow</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/first_blood\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/first_blood-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">First Blood</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/five_alive\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/five_alive-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Five Alive</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-epic\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/momentum\" title=\"Epic perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/momentum-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Runaway Train</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-rare\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/jackpot\" title=\"Rare perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/jackpot-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Jackpot Ends</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-rare\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/royal_flush\" title=\"Rare perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/royal_flush-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Royal Train</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-uncommon\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/branch_bank\" title=\"Uncommon perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/branch_bank-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Branch Bank</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/insurance\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/insurance-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Round Insurance</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-rare\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/collector\" title=\"Rare perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/collector-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Collector</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-rare\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/domino_effect\" title=\"Rare perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/domino_effect-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Domino Effect</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-epic\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/echo\" title=\"Epic perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/echo-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Echo Chamber</a> and <a class=\"ref rarity-epic\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/long_count\" title=\"Epic perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/long_count-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">The Long Charge</a>.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-legendary\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/midas\" title=\"Legendary perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/midas-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Midas Touch</a></strong> doubles the sum of the step 2 bonuses, once per copy.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-epic\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/golden_double\" title=\"Epic perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/golden_double-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Golden Double</a></strong> doubles the whole play so far if you played a double, once per copy.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-legendary\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/equalizer\" title=\"Legendary perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/equalizer-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">The Equalizer</a></strong> doubles the whole play so far if you were 30 or more behind, once per copy.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-malus\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/cracked\" title=\"Malus\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/cracked-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Cracked Doubles</a></strong> takes 5 per copy off a double.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-malus\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/jinx\" title=\"Malus\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/jinx-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Five Jinx</a></strong> wipes out a play whose open ends total exactly 5.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-malus\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/tax\" title=\"Malus\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/tax-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Perk Tax</a></strong> takes 1 per copy for each bonus line on the play (steps 2 to 5), but never below the open-end total and never adding points.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-uncommon\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/shield\" title=\"Uncommon perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/shield-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Pip Shield</a></strong> gives back up to 5 per copy of what steps 6 to 8 took.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref ref-skill\" href=\"/hop/wiki/skills#malus_ward\" title=\"Skill tree: House Rules\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/skills/malus_ward-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Malus Ward</a></strong>, if charged, cancels the first malus that took points, and Pip Shield is worked out again.</li><li><strong>Skill bonuses</strong>: <a class=\"ref ref-skill\" href=\"/hop/wiki/skills#coffin_corner\" title=\"Skill tree: Table Sense\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/skills/coffin_corner-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Coffin Corner</a> adds its points if the play still scores.</li></ol>\n<p>The order of step 2 only matters for <a class=\"ref rarity-epic\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/echo\" title=\"Epic perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/echo-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Echo Chamber</a>, which repeats the last bonus line added on your previous bonus-earning play.</p>\n<aside class=\"callout callout-example\"><p class=\"callout-title\">A big play, step by step</p><p>You hold <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/doubles\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/doubles-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Double Trouble</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/even_flow\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/even_flow-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Even Flow</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-legendary\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/midas\" title=\"Legendary perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/midas-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Midas Touch</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-epic\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/golden_double\" title=\"Epic perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/golden_double-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Golden Double</a> and the <a class=\"ref rarity-malus\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/tax\" title=\"Malus\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/tax-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Perk Tax</a> malus. You play 3-3 and the open ends total 15.</p>\n<ul><li>Step 1, open ends: <strong>15</strong>.</li><li>Step 2, Double Trouble +5 and Even Flow +5: <strong>25</strong>.</li><li>Step 3, Midas Touch doubles the 10 bonus points: <strong>35</strong>.</li><li>Step 4, Golden Double doubles the play: <strong>70</strong>.</li><li>Step 8, Perk Tax: four bonus lines (Double Trouble, Even Flow, Midas Touch, Golden Double) and one copy, so -4: <strong>66</strong>.</li></ul>\n<p>With one <a class=\"ref rarity-uncommon\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/shield\" title=\"Uncommon perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/shield-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Pip Shield</a> as well, the 4 taxed points come back and the play scores <strong>70</strong>.</p></aside>\n<h2 id=\"after-the-play\">After the play <a class=\"anchor\" href=\"/hop/wiki/scoring#after-the-play\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-malus\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/stumble\" title=\"Malus\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/stumble-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Stumble</a></strong> forces a boneyard draw at the start of your next turn if the play scored.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-legendary\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/time_loop\" title=\"Legendary perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/time_loop-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Time Loop</a></strong>, if armed, gives you another turn if the play scored.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-epic\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/long_count\" title=\"Epic perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/long_count-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">The Long Charge</a></strong> banks a charge if the play didn't score, or empties its bank if the open ends totalled exactly 5.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-rare\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/domino_effect\" title=\"Rare perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/domino_effect-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Domino Effect</a></strong>, <a class=\"ref rarity-uncommon\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/chain\" title=\"Uncommon perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/chain-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Hot Streak</a> and <a class=\"ref rarity-epic\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/momentum\" title=\"Epic perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/momentum-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Runaway Train</a> update their streaks.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"the-order-of-a-hand-award\">The order of a hand award <a class=\"anchor\" href=\"/hop/wiki/scoring#the-order-of-a-hand-award\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<p>When a hand ends, the winner scores the loser's remaining pips. Perks held by the <strong>loser</strong> change the award in this order:</p>\n<ol><li>Start with the loser's <strong>remaining pips</strong>.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-legendary\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/immunity\" title=\"Legendary perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/immunity-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Untouchable Hand</a></strong> makes the award zero and skips steps 3 to 6.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-epic\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/fortress\" title=\"Epic perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/fortress-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Bone Fortress</a></strong> caps the award at 10.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/soft_landing\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/soft_landing-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Soft Landing</a></strong> takes off 5 per copy (never below zero).</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-malus\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/heavy_hand\" title=\"Malus\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/heavy_hand-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Heavy Hand</a></strong> adds 5 per copy.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-malus\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/exposed\" title=\"Malus\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/exposed-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Exposed Hand</a></strong> adds 25% per copy, compounding, rounded up.</li><li><strong><a class=\"ref ref-skill\" href=\"/hop/wiki/skills#malus_ward\" title=\"Skill tree: House Rules\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/skills/malus_ward-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Malus Ward</a></strong>, if the loser has it charged, cancels the malus applied last.</li></ol>\n<p>Then the <strong>winner's</strong> perk applies:</p>\n<ol><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-epic\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/close\" title=\"Epic perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/close-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Clean Finish</a></strong> doubles the award per copy, but only when the winner went domino.</li><li>The result is <strong>rounded up to the next multiple of five</strong>.</li></ol>\n<aside class=\"callout callout-example\"><p class=\"callout-title\">Worked example</p><p>You lose holding 18 pips with one <a class=\"ref rarity-epic\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/fortress\" title=\"Epic perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/fortress-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Bone Fortress</a> and one <a class=\"ref rarity-malus\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/heavy_hand\" title=\"Malus\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/heavy_hand-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Heavy Hand</a>. Fortress caps the award at 10, Heavy Hand adds 5: 15. If Rival went domino holding one <a class=\"ref rarity-epic\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/close\" title=\"Epic perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/close-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Clean Finish</a>, it doubles to <strong>30</strong>.</p></aside>\n<h2 id=\"malus-points-outside-a-play\">Malus points outside a play <a class=\"anchor\" href=\"/hop/wiki/scoring#malus-points-outside-a-play\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><strong><a class=\"ref rarity-malus\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/leak\" title=\"Malus\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/leak-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Leaky Pocket</a></strong> takes 2 points per copy from your match score each time you draw. It is not part of any play, so <a class=\"ref rarity-uncommon\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/shield\" title=\"Uncommon perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/shield-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Pip Shield</a> doesn't cover it.</li><li>Your match score never drops below zero.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"points-xp-and-bone-bucks\">Points, XP and Bone Bucks <a class=\"anchor\" href=\"/hop/wiki/scoring#points-xp-and-bone-bucks\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Every point you score, from plays and hand awards alike, also earns career XP, and the points you bank in a hand add to that hand's Bone Bucks. See <a href=\"/hop/wiki/career\">Career, XP and Bone Bucks</a>.</p>","toc":[{"id":"which-plays-score","text":"Which plays score"},{"id":"reading-the-flying-counts","text":"Reading the flying counts"},{"id":"the-order-on-a-scoring-play","text":"The order on a scoring play"},{"id":"after-the-play","text":"After the play"},{"id":"the-order-of-a-hand-award","text":"The order of a hand award"},{"id":"malus-points-outside-a-play","text":"Malus points outside a play"},{"id":"points-xp-and-bone-bucks","text":"Points, XP and Bone Bucks"}]}